{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And the sons of Kehat, Amram and Yitzhar, etc.</b> That he did not enumerate the sons of Moshes and the sons of Chevron and the sons of Itamar — this is because no event occurred among them; but he enumerated the sons of Amram because they are mentioned in the Torah several times, and the sons of Yitzhar because of the dispute of Korah, and the sons of Uzziel because of 'Moshes called to Mishael and to Eltzafan, sons of Uzziel'; but the sons of Itamar are mentioned in Chronicles on account of Eli the priest."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:56:20.589348913Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}